 
                             RUST SUPPORT IN KERNEL
                             ----------------------

1. Introduction
----------------

Enable rust support in kernel for on target development. 

If you need more details, Please see https://docs.kernel.org/rust/index.html

2. Usage
--------

Add this template using the following configure script option.
i.e.: --templates feature/rust-in-kernel-target

This will ensure the required config values are set and will enable support kernel module development on target.
